# Xcode / Swift build artifacts and per-user state.
# Kept here rather than in the repo root so the tvOS toolchain's noise stays
# scoped to its own directory.

## Build output
build/
DerivedData/
*.o
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

## Per-user Xcode state — never shared, and a constant source of pointless diffs
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout
*.moved-aside

## Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/

## CocoaPods / Carthage (only if either is adopted later)
Pods/
Carthage/Build/

## macOS
.DS_Store
